sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as School User
    participant UI as LoginView (Desktop UI)
    participant Auth as AuthenticationService
    participant Repo as UserRepository
    participant DB as Central Database
    User->>UI: Enter username and password; click Login
    UI->>UI: Validate required fields
    alt Required fields missing
        UI-->>User: Display field validation
    else Required fields present
        UI->>Auth: authenticate(username, password)
        Auth->>Repo: findByUsername(username)
        Repo->>DB: Retrieve account and password hash
        DB-->>Repo: Account record or not found
        Repo-->>Auth: Account record or not found
        alt Unknown/disabled account or invalid password
            Auth-->>UI: AuthenticationFailed
            UI-->>User: Generic login error
        else Valid credentials and active account
            Auth->>Repo: loadRolesAndPermissions(userId)
            Repo->>DB: Retrieve active roles and permissions
            DB-->>Repo: Roles and permissions
            Repo-->>Auth: Roles and permissions
            Auth->>Auth: Establish application session
            Auth-->>UI: Authorized session context
            UI-->>User: Open authorized dashboard
        end
    end
    Note over Auth,DB: Password verification is performed in business logic; never expose password hashes to UI.
